---
/** Site-wide footer: where the catalog comes from, and what this site is (and is not). */
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <p>
    Catalog data from the community-maintained Ye Tracker spreadsheet
    (<a href="https://yetracker.net">yetracker.net</a>).
  </p>
  <p>Unofficial fan-made viewer, not affiliated with Ye or his labels.</p>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 90rem;
    margin: 2rem auto 0;
    padding: 1.25rem max(1rem, env(safe-area-inset-right)) 1.5rem max(1rem, env(safe-area-inset-left));
    border-top: 1px solid #333333;
    color: #b0b0b0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .site-footer p {
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
  }
  .site-footer a {
    color: #e6e6e6;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
  }
  .site-footer a:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
</style>
